{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44300","headline":"寄洛中诸姊 · 元淳","name":"寄洛中诸姊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧国经年别，关河万里思。\n题诗凭鴈翼，望月想蛾眉。\n白发愁偏觉，归心梦独知。\n谁堪离乱处，掩泪向南枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元淳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}